.SH NAME
QDialog \- The base class of dialog windows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qdialog.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QWidget.
.PP
Inherited by QColorDialog, QFileDialog, QFontDialog, QMessageBox, QTabDialog and QWizard.
.PP
